nd regulatory compliance of mechanical systems supporting academic, residential, administrative, athletic, and ... View Details Bookmark Building Maintenance Foreman - Plumbing Shop P01336 Maintenance Operations About the position:Lead and participate in a variety of skilled and semiskilled activities in the installation, maintenance and repair of plumbing fixtures and systems to maintain infrastructure in safe, sanitary, and code compliant working conditions; operate and maintain the campus potable water, sanitary, and storm sewer infrastructure; develop and implement plumbing projects; and manage ass... View Details Bookmark Cook 1 P01325 Dining and Catering Services About the position:Cook, grill, bake, steam, sauté, and fry food for student meals, catering, conferences. Responsible for sanitation of work area and equipment.Join Our Team at Millersville University!Hourly Rate: $18.83Plus a generous benefits package designed to support your well-being and future:Comprehensive Health Coverage – Medical, dental, and vision insuranceGroup Life InsuranceRetirem... View Details Bookmark Food Service Supervisor 1, 9 month – Anchor P01241 Dining and Catering Services About the position:The Food Service Supervisor 1 works as a supervisor over a large-scale food serving area in an institutional food service operation. This position is responsible for supervising food service work performed in multiple service areas; a cafeteria having multiple serving lines; or other areas of comparable scope and complexity. Work involves the supervision and training of food ... View Details Bookmark Food Service Supervisor 1 – Chick Fil A (2:30pm-10:30pm) P01331 Dining and Catering Services About the position:The Food Service Supervisor 1 must establish and maintain effective working relationships with all employees. Throughout the work shift, the supervisor is responsible for enforcing Dining Service policies and procedures by working with and supervising cooks, food service workers, student managers and student workers. Supervision includes assigning work and following up to ens... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Hourly Food Service Worker 1, 9 month - Chick-Fil-A P01303 Dining and Catering Services About the position:Assignments could be in the dish room, kitchen, vegetable preparation area, serving areas, dining rooms, deli/convenience stores, catering and receiving.Join Our Team at Millersville University!Hourly Rate: $16.73Why Millersville?Nestled in beautiful Lancaster County, Pennsylvania, Millersville University is a proud member of Pennsylvania’s State System of Higher Education. W... View Details Bookmark Medium Voltage Electrician P01278 Maintenance Operations About the position:This is specialized electrical work in the operation, maintenance and repair of medium voltage electrical systems and equipment.Join Our Team at Millersville University!Position Salary: $46,827.00 annuallyPlus a generous benefits package designed to support your well-being and future:Comprehensive Health Coverage – Medical, dental, and vision insuranceGroup Life InsuranceReti... View Details Bookmark HVAC Mechanic P01269 Maintenance Operations About the position:An employee in this job performs routine maintenance, inspections, and repairs on HVAC and refrigeration system components according to a prescribed set of instructions. Work involves responding to service calls, conducting assessments, and performing adjustments to equipment to resolve occupant comfort issues. Work is performed according to established guidelines and include... View Details Bookmark Plumber 1 P01185 Maintenance Operations About the position:The Plumber will perform maintenance, inspection, repair, replacement, and installation work on plumbing systems, sewer line systems, or distribution lines that are both exterior and interior to facilities. Work involves measuring, cutting, threading, bending, and assembling pipe; troubleshooting, repairing, assembling, or replacing fittings, fixtures, and components; and uti... View Details Bookmark To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
